# Files that decide which rules are enforced and how the gate runs.
# strspc diff compares rule files only: a change to these could weaken
# enforcement without a rule changing (strspc-manager SPEC §7.3). With
# "Require review from Code Owners" on the develop and main rulesets, a
# pull request that touches them needs cnslr-bt-chef's approval, not the
# auto-approver's.
/.strspc/config.yaml  @cnslr-bt-chef
/rules/realm.json     @cnslr-bt-chef
/.github/workflows/   @cnslr-bt-chef
/.github/actions/     @cnslr-bt-chef
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @cnslr-bt-chef
